{"seq":1,"slug":"spectral-lines-21cm","title":"谱线与 21 厘米","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/science/spectral-lines-21cm","wordCount":1727,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"谱线与-21-厘米\">谱线与 21 厘米</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>连续谱告诉我们&quot;那里有相对论电子或热气体&quot;，但要回答&quot;那团气体是什么、有多少、走多快、温度多高&quot;，必须借助谱线。射电波段的谱线来自原子与分子能级间的跃迁，每一条都是一把精密的标尺：它的中心频率标定成分，它的多普勒移动标定速度，它的强度标定柱密度。其中最著名、影响最深远的一条，是中性氢的 21 厘米线——它让我们既能称出整个银河系的旋转曲线（暗物质的第一缕证据），又能回望宇宙的黑暗时代。这一篇把<a href=\"../foundations/radio-bands-mechanisms\">射电波段与辐射机制</a>里点到的&quot;谱线辐射&quot;展开成射电天文最丰饶的科学分支。</p>\n<p>谱线观测的本质是把接收机带宽切成成百上千个细频道（见<a href=\"../telescopes/receivers-noise\">接收机与噪声</a>中谱线对带宽的特殊处理），逐频道测强度，画出谱线轮廓，再从轮廓反演物理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原子/分子能级跃迁] --&gt; B[中性氢 21cm&lt;br/&gt;超精细自旋翻转]&#10;  A --&gt; C[分子谱线&lt;br/&gt;CO·NH3·甲醇]&#10;  A --&gt; D[复合线/脉泽]&#10;  B --&gt; E[银河系旋转曲线&lt;br/&gt;暗物质]&#10;  B --&gt; F[宇宙再电离与黎明&lt;br/&gt;红移21cm]&#10;  C --&gt; G[分子云·恒星形成]&#10;  D --&gt; H[致密区·恒星诞生]&#10;  F --&gt; I[全局信号 SARAS]&#10;  F --&gt; J[功率谱 HERA/SKA-Low]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原子/分子能级跃迁] --&gt; B[中性氢 21cm&lt;br/&gt;超精细自旋翻转]\n  A --&gt; C[分子谱线&lt;br/&gt;CO·NH3·甲醇]\n  A --&gt; D[复合线/脉泽]\n  B --&gt; E[银河系旋转曲线&lt;br/&gt;暗物质]\n  B --&gt; F[宇宙再电离与黎明&lt;br/&gt;红移21cm]\n  C --&gt; G[分子云·恒星形成]\n  D --&gt; H[致密区·恒星诞生]\n  F --&gt; I[全局信号 SARAS]\n  F --&gt; J[功率谱 HERA/SKA-Low]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>谱线</th>\n<th>静止频率</th>\n<th>探针对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HI 21cm</td>\n<td>1420.4 MHz</td>\n<td>中性氢、旋转曲线、再电离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CO(1-0)</td>\n<td>115.3 GHz</td>\n<td>分子云、恒星形成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水脉泽</td>\n<td>22.2 GHz</td>\n<td>致密恒星形成、AGN 盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>甲醇脉泽</td>\n<td>6.7 GHz</td>\n<td>大质量恒星形成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"21-厘米线的物理\">21 厘米线的物理</h2><p>中性氢原子的电子与质子自旋可平行或反平行，这两个超精细态间的能差极小，对应跃迁频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1420.405</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1420.405</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1420.405</span></span></span></span></span> MHz，即波长 21 厘米。单个氢原子发生这种自旋翻转的几率低到平均上千万年才一次，但宇宙里中性氢实在太多，使 21cm 成为最易探测的射电谱线之一。</p>\n<p>它的科学威力来自三重身份。其一，作为速度探针：测量谱线相对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1420.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1420.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1420.4</span></span></span></span></span> MHz 的多普勒移动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ν</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\nu/\\nu = v/c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，就读出气体的视向速度。正是用 21cm 测出的银河系旋转曲线在大半径处不下降，给出了暗物质存在的最早动力学证据之一。其二，作为质量探针：光学薄时 21cm 强度正比于中性氢柱密度，能直接称量星系的气体储量。其三，作为宇宙学探针：高红移的 21cm 被宇宙膨胀拉伸到米波，成为窥探宇宙黎明的唯一直接信使。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分子谱线与脉泽\">分子谱线与脉泽</h2><p>冷到中性氢都难以激发的分子云里，谱线主角换成分子。一氧化碳的 CO(1-0) 转动跃迁在 115 GHz，是追踪分子气体（恒星的原料）的标准探针；氨、甲醛、氰化氢等数百种星际分子各有指纹谱线，让射电望远镜成了宇宙化学的质谱仪。这些毫米波谱线正是 ALMA 的主场，也呼应了<a href=\"../foundations/atmosphere-windows\">大气与射电窗口</a>里&quot;毫米波需极干燥站址&quot;的要求。</p>\n<p>脉泽（射电波段的激光）则是另一类奇观：在恒星形成区和某些 AGN 的吸积盘里，水（22 GHz）、甲醇（6.7 GHz）、羟基等分子被泵浦到能级布居反转，谱线被极度放大，亮温度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> K 以上。脉泽点状、明亮、致密，是 VLBI（见<a href=\"../interferometry/aperture-synthesis-vlbi\">综合孔径与 VLBI</a>）测量恒星形成区几何与 AGN 中心黑洞质量的绝佳信标——NGC 4258 的水脉泽盘就给出了黑洞质量的&quot;金标准&quot;测量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"宇宙黎明与再电离\">宇宙黎明与再电离</h2><p>把 21cm 的红移用到极致，就触及射电宇宙学最激动人心的前沿。大爆炸后的&quot;黑暗时代&quot;里宇宙充满中性氢，第一代恒星与星系点亮后逐步把氢电离（再电离时代，EoR）。这段历史在可见光里几乎不可见，却在 21cm 上留下印记：红移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\sim 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 的 21cm 信号被拉伸到约 50–200 MHz 的低频波段。</p>\n<p>观测分两条路线。其一是全局信号：用单天线测整个天空 21cm 相对前景的平均吸收/发射深度，SARAS 3 等实验给出了对宇宙黎明的约束（此前 EDGES 报告的异常吸收尚存争议）。其二是功率谱：用低频干涉阵列测 21cm 涨落的统计，HERA 已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\sim 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\sim 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 的上限，约束了再电离时星际介质必须已被加热到绝热冷却阈值以上。最大的挑战是前景比信号强约五个数量级，以及<a href=\"../foundations/atmosphere-windows\">电离层与 RFI</a>的污染——这正是 <a href=\"ska-future\">SKA-Low</a> 被寄予厚望去突破的方向：用海量低频天线把 EoR 从&quot;统计上限&quot;推向&quot;直接成像&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>探测方式</th>\n<th>测量量</th>\n<th>代表实验</th>\n<th>现状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局信号</td>\n<td>平均 21cm 深度</td>\n<td>SARAS 3、EDGES</td>\n<td>给出约束/存争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功率谱</td>\n<td>21cm 涨落统计</td>\n<td>HERA、LOFAR</td>\n<td>上限持续收紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层析成像</td>\n<td>逐红移成像</td>\n<td>SKA-Low（未来）</td>\n<td>目标方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"谱线的观测难度-为什么比连续谱贵\">谱线的观测难度：为什么比连续谱贵</h2><p>谱线科学丰饶，代价却高昂，根源在于<a href=\"../telescopes/receivers-noise\">接收机与噪声</a>里的辐射计方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ν</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta T_{\\rm rms}=T_{\\rm sys}/\\sqrt{\\Delta\\nu\\,\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">rms</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2128em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">sys</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。连续谱可以把整段宽带当作一个频道，用全部带宽换取灵敏度；而谱线必须把带宽切成成百上千个细频道来分辨轮廓，每个频道分到的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 因此极小，同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\rm sys}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">sys</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下灵敏度成倍变差。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测类型</th>\n<th>有效带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>相对灵敏度</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连续谱</td>\n<td>整段宽带（GHz 级）</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>无频率分辨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谱线</td>\n<td>单频道（kHz–MHz）</td>\n<td>低得多</td>\n<td>需远长积分/更多集光面积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉泽</td>\n<td>极窄带</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>靠其极高亮温度补偿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这就引出一条谱线观测的通用权衡：要分辨的速度结构越细（频道越窄），需要的积分时间就越长。脉泽之所以仍能被轻松探测，靠的正是它 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> K 量级的超高亮温度补偿了极窄带宽带来的灵敏度损失。因此谱线观测往往集中在集光面积最大的单天线（如 FAST）或灵敏度极高的阵列上——谱线是这个 hub 里最&quot;吃望远镜本钱&quot;的业务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>谱线把&quot;有什么&quot;变成&quot;是什么、多少、多快、多热&quot;：中心频率定成分、多普勒移定速度、强度定柱密度，是射电定量科学的核心工具。</li>\n<li>21cm 中性氢线身兼速度探针（银河系旋转曲线→暗物质）、质量探针（气体储量）、宇宙学探针（高红移宇宙黎明）三职。</li>\n<li>分子谱线（CO、氨等）与脉泽（水、甲醇）追踪冷分子云与恒星形成，脉泽的致密高亮使其成为 <a href=\"../interferometry/aperture-synthesis-vlbi\">VLBI</a> 测黑洞质量的金标准信标。</li>\n<li>高红移 21cm 是窥探再电离与宇宙黎明的唯一直接信使，全局信号（SARAS）与功率谱（HERA）已给约束，<a href=\"ska-future\">SKA-Low</a> 的目标是直接成像。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"谱线与 21 厘米","id":"谱线与-21-厘米"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"21 厘米线的物理","id":"21-厘米线的物理"},{"level":2,"text":"分子谱线与脉泽","id":"分子谱线与脉泽"},{"level":2,"text":"宇宙黎明与再电离","id":"宇宙黎明与再电离"},{"level":2,"text":"谱线的观测难度：为什么比连续谱贵","id":"谱线的观测难度-为什么比连续谱贵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成像与去卷积","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/interferometry/imaging-deconvolution"},"next":{"title":"脉冲星与快速射电暴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/science/pulsars-frbs"}}